2.ZEROS COUNT 
Given an array arr[] of only 0's and 1's. The array is sorted in descending order. Find the count of all the 0's.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            int countZeroes(int arr[], int n) {
                // code here
                int count=0;
                for(int i=0;i<n;i++){
                    if(arr[i]==0){
                        count++;
                    }
                }
                return count;
            }
        }
